		{"id":"527b3c1437994bd3","type":"text","text":"# ENGINE FAILED / TIMED OUT\nDurable Platform record retained.\nShow useful summary; new run may be created.","x":1180,"y":100,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"187362fdaa7340c3","type":"text","text":"# CANCELLATION REQUESTED → CANCELLED\nPlatform records intent, Engine coordinates actual compute-provider cancellation.","x":180,"y":400,"width":950,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"19572854126d4da1","type":"text","text":"# IMPORT FAILED\nDo **not** rerun science automatically.\nRetry manifest/artifact import.","x":1180,"y":430,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"793adc14f446420c","type":"text","text":"## Mapping principle\nThe Platform exposes **stable, comprehensible stages**. The Engine can have many more technical states such as `STAGING_INPUTS`, `SUBMITTED_TO_SLURM`, `RUNNING_FOLDING` or `PUBLISHING_ARTIFACTS`. Those details are mapped, not copied wholesale into the product model.","x":-820,"y":1050,"width":2000,"height":230,"color":"2"}
